# Secrets — NEVER COMMIT
#
# This directory holds the Ed25519 PRIVATE signing key for offline credentials.
# Anyone holding this key can mint an offline credential for any user or device,
# which completely defeats the offline authorization model in docs/auth.md.
#
# Losing the key means every already-activated device must re-authenticate.
# Leaking the key means every offline credential ever issued is forgeable.
#
# The matching PUBLIC key lives at services/auth/keys/ and IS safe to commit.
/services/auth/secrets/

# Local environment overrides
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Generated signing material, anywhere it may land
*.pem
*.key
signing_ed25519*
